  - 'Agent: Dr. Robert, what is the latest level of education that you have received?'
  - 'Doctor: Isn''t that obvious? Look at my certificates in the wall!'
  - 'Agent: heh... I see... And how''s the hospital business going with you?'
  - 'Doctor: Going well... By the end of the day we get paid the most...'
  - 'Agent: Any numbers?'
  - 'Doctor: $100K! Maybe even more!!'
  - 'Agent: ... Thank you for your time... I''ll be seeing you soon'
